{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfs2aCY8zQDURMU9BA27v","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both bugs are fixed in `sched/core.py`, and `tests/test_sched.py` now passes (1 passed). The signature is unchanged.\n\n**Root causes**\n\n1. **Skipped day after 22:00 UTC:** `today = now.date()` took the date in UTC, not in `tz`. For 23:30 UTC on June 1 (01:30 June 2 in Berlin), the function built June 1 01:00 Berlin, which is in the past. It then added 24 hours in UTC and returned June 2 01:00 Berlin. That is still before `now` (23:00 UTC), and the function never re-checked it. The next valid run was skipped.\n\n2. **Off by one hour around DST:** The \"advance one day\" step added 24 elapsed UTC hours to a zone-local time. Across the March spring-forward, 24 elapsed hours is not the same as one calendar day, so the wall-clock time shifted by an hour.\n\n**The fix**\n\n- Take the calendar date with `now.astimezone(zone).date()`, so it is the date in the target zone.\n- Loop over calendar days: build the `hour:minute` candidate in `zone`, return it if it is strictly after `now`, otherwise step the date forward by one day. This removes the stale-candidate case and the elapsed-hours arithmetic.\n\n**Verification**\n\n- `pytest tests/` passes.\n- Spot checks around the March 29, 2026 Berlin DST change:\n  - 12:00 UTC on Mar 28 for 01:30 gives Mar 29 01:30+01:00.\n  - 00:30 UTC on Mar 29 for 01:30 gives Mar 30 01:30+02:00, since 01:30 Mar 29 is not strictly after `now`.\n  - 22:00 UTC on Mar 29 for 08:00 gives Mar 30 08:00+02:00, with the wall-clock time preserved.\n  - A naive `now` is still treated as UTC, and the result stays at 08:00 wall-clock.\n\nI did not commit anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3578,"cache_read_input_tokens":37233,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3578},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd8f5570-4c48-414d-a9a2-f7d71224c929","uuid":"b2c091c0-a3a5-4236-a555-a8df9f8981e8","timestamp":"2026-10-09T17:05:49.113Z","request_id":"req_011Cfs2aCGkk2ddTyDJeqrEf"}
